OL,3,GNEWSACanal breach could take months to 
OL,4,Arepair                                 
OL,6,FThe trust said: "With the pumping      
OL,7,Foperation now fully established, our   
OL,8,Ffocus will turn to investigating the   
OL,9,Fcause of the breach and developing a   
OL,10,Frepair plan."                          
